sink, and this is also how you fall

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:25.240
asleep more easily. So, choose one

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:27.720
desire, one thing to work on, and create

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:29.560
your scene out of that one thing, or set

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:31.720
your sensory shift. Try one of the two

00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:33.280
methods, either the mind movie or

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:35.160
shifting your senses. And after you do

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:37.360
that, check your beliefs. Do you feel

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:39.680
any resistance? It's okay if you do, so

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:42.480
name that resistance, acknowledge it,

00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:44.520
don't fight it, and then continue to

00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:46.400
keep looping gently, just like someone's

