because scientifically speaking, there's

00:17:57.280 --> 00:18:01.560
research done on forming habits that

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:03.760
show new behavioral patterns begin to

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:06.280
emerge and create [music] significant

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:08.680
shifts around 3 weeks. So, give your

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:10.680
subconscious mind that courtesy of

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:12.240
adjusting to one of these methods before

