morning, and maybe nothing changes. So,

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:22.120
your mind thinks, "See, I told you this

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:23.920
wouldn't work." Instead of jumping into

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.640
conclusions like what I've done for

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:27.600
years and years and wasting my time,

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:29.200
watch out for all of these subtle shifts

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:31.840
in how you feel when you wake up for the

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:33.440
next 21 days, and notice all of these

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:35.240
little subtle things, whether it's

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:37.360
something that happens to you or random

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:39.400
thought that comes into your head that

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:41.800
you wouldn't otherwise think about.

00:18:39.400 --> 00:18:42.640
Notice when you respond to something

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.480
differently [music]

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:46.360
than you otherwise would, and you're not

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:49.040
