00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:56.320
desire lives. There is a series of very

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:57.880
small and seemingly unrelated events

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:59.800
that your subconscious mind will

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:01.760
orchestrate to bridge [music] this gap.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:04.280
It's almost like the hurdles or the

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:06.000
tasks or the steps that you have to take

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:07.880
in order to get there. That's your

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:09.920
bridge. Carl Jung will call these

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:11.760
synchronicities or sympathetic

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:14.400
